{
  "checked": "Every line here is checked by the tests named under it, on every change to AI Juggler. A line without a test can't be added.",
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": "reads",
      "title": "What it reads, on your Mac only",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "no-credentials",
          "text": "It never reads your passwords, tokens or API keys, or the tools' Keychain items. It reads only whether you're signed in, and as which account: its email and organisation.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/no_bare_tools.rs::no_sign_in_file_is_read",
            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/claude_code_adapter.rs::login_state_is_metadata_only",
            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/scan.rs::scan_code_never_reads_credential_contents",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/environment_scan_no_cli.rs::the_environment_scan_runs_no_vendor_cli"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "settings-parts",
          "text": "From Claude Code's settings.json it reads only the settings it needs, each one named in its code and checked.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/no_bare_tools.rs::no_sign_in_file_is_read"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "changes",
      "title": "What it changes",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "own-folder",
          "text": "What it keeps lives in its own folder, ~/Library/Application Support/AI Juggler (AI Juggler Nightly for Nightly), and in its own Keychain items.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/src/edition.rs::ai_juggler_keeps_its_existing_folder_keychain_items_and_port"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "in-place-untouched",
          "text": "It never writes to a setup you use where it is, unless you turn on a change that says so first.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/in_place_accounts.rs::a_setup_used_where_it_is_is_never_written_by_ai_juggler",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/codex_in_place.rs::a_codex_home_used_where_it_is_is_never_written_by_ai_juggler"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "only-what-you-apply",
          "text": "It changes your setups and projects only when you apply a change, shows it first, and can undo it.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/outside_capture.rs::turning_it_on_changes_only_the_status_line_and_off_puts_every_byte_back",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/project_sync.rs::nothing_is_written_until_the_user_applies",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/switch_setup.rs::the_other_claude_account_is_offered_what_it_lacks_and_gets_only_what_is_picked",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/account_settings.rs::a_new_account_gets_the_usual_settings_and_never_a_credential_history_or_cache"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "no-secret-copied",
          "text": "Copying settings or MCP servers never takes a secret along: the copy names it, and you provide it.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/account_settings.rs::a_setting_with_a_secret_written_in_it_is_never_copied_or_recorded",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/project_sync.rs::a_server_is_copied_across_tools_without_its_secret_and_undone",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/switch_setup.rs::the_other_claude_account_is_offered_what_it_lacks_and_gets_only_what_is_picked"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "uninstall",
          "text": "Before you uninstall, it can take out the one setting it may have added to a Claude account, and keep any edits you made since.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/outside_capture.rs::preparing_to_uninstall_puts_status_lines_back_and_lists_whats_left"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sends",
      "title": "What it sends",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "no-ai-provider",
          "text": "It makes no requests to Anthropic, OpenAI or any other AI provider. Your tools talk to their providers themselves.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::only_the_listed_crates_can_reach_the_network",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::the_app_reaches_only_its_own_addresses",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::the_window_can_reach_nothing_but_the_app",
            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/quota_ingest.rs::no_http_client_anywhere_in_the_adapters_crate"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "no-proxy",
          "text": "It never sits between your tools and their providers: it sets no proxy or provider address for them.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::ai_juggler_never_points_a_tool_at_another_address"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "updates",
          "text": "It checks GitHub for updates when it starts, if that's on, or when you choose Check now.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/updates_plugin.rs::check_off_means_zero_connections_and_on_reaches_the_feed",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::the_app_reaches_only_its_own_addresses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "stats",
          "text": "Usage statistics are off until you choose. When on, they go to stats.figurehead.ai as counts only: never your words, files, paths or names.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/stats_guardrails.rs::without_a_choice_nothing_is_created_and_nothing_is_sent",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/stats_guardrails.rs::nothing_the_user_owns_reaches_the_stats_store_or_a_report",
            "crates/juggler-stats/src/tests.rs::off_creates_no_folder_and_records_nothing",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::the_app_reaches_only_its_own_addresses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "crash-reports",
          "text": "Crash reports are kept on your Mac, with names and paths taken out. This version has nowhere to send them.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/src/crash.rs::a_seeded_crash_is_scrubbed_before_it_is_kept",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::crash_reports_have_nowhere_to_go"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "account",
          "text": "The Figurehead account is optional. Signed out, nothing goes to it; signed in, a feature you've turned off sends nothing.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/cloud_guardrails.rs::g1_signed_out_is_silent",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/cloud_guardrails.rs::g2_a_feature_that_is_off_never_calls_its_endpoint"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fleet",
          "text": "Fleet connects only Macs you paired, directly and encrypted, each checking the other's key, and no server carries the traffic. To be found, a Mac announces itself on your local network, and in your Figurehead account if you turn that on.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-link/tests/transport.rs::mutual_tls_with_pinned_keys_connects_and_serves",
            "crates/juggler-link/tests/transport.rs::a_node_presenting_an_unpinned_key_is_refused_at_tls",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::only_the_listed_crates_can_reach_the_network"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "never",
      "title": "What it never does",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "no-sign-in",
          "text": "It never signs in for you. A sign-in is always the tool's own, and AI Juggler never reads the secret the tool saves.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/claude_code_adapter.rs::login_spec_points_at_isolated_dir",
            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/codex_adapter.rs::login_spec_runs_the_vendor_flow_in_the_isolated_home",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/no_bare_tools.rs::no_sign_in_file_is_read"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "no-auto-switch",
          "text": "It never moves your work to another account by itself. Every switch starts from a click, on this Mac or on a Mac you paired.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/trust.rs::nothing_switches_on_its_own",
            "ui/src/screens/privacy-page.test.tsx::only the switch screens start a switch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "no-test-bridge",
          "text": "The test bridge the developers use is not in the app you download.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/dev_bridge_feature.rs::the_dev_bridge_is_not_a_default_feature"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
